                {
                  "text": "Speak the closing_message argument as the terminal business outcome. Use only the public facts in this conversation. Do not ask a question or include a verification code, internal pricing or private information. For senior_review say exactly: We have agreed on the rate. A senior representative will review and confirm the booking. I am now transferring you to a senior representative; this transfer is simulated for the demo. For other terminal outcomes explain the actual refusal or failure briefly and say goodbye without a transfer."
                }
              ]
