              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "The short terminal business outcome to say aloud, with no codes or confidential pricing. For senior_review use the complete required neutral mocked-transfer line. Otherwise give the actual refusal or result and goodbye."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "description": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Use this tool to SPEAK the terminal outcome and close the call record as one action. Pass closing_message and invoke immediately on no_match, ineligible, code_failed, negotiation_failed, unavailable outcomes or senior_review. Do not deliver separate final chat text first. The configured voice message speaks your words. After it returns, invoke the native end_conversation hangup tool."
